!! Listing active markers

The `cm-active-markers` filter operator returns marker titles active for a given tiddler.

```
[<currentTiddler>cm-active-markers[block]]
[<currentTiddler>cm-active-markers[inline]]
[<currentTiddler>cm-active-markers[word]]
```

Empty source falls back to vocab/default so a dropdown without an edit context still renders a usable list.

!! Summary views (ViewTemplate)

Opening a marker tiddler, a vocabulary tiddler, or a marker-tag tiddler shows a summary instead of an empty body. Three cascade tiddlers under `$:/plugins/wikilabs/custom-markup/ViewTemplateBodyFilters/` (each tagged <<tag $:/tags/ViewTemplateBodyFilter>>) route:

* tag <<tag $:/tags/CustomMarkup/Marker>> on the tiddler being viewed: per-marker fields summary.
* the tiddler title itself is a marker-tag (e.g. `vocab/default`): catalog of every marker carrying that tag.
* tag <<tag $:/tags/CustomMarkup/Vocabulary>>: caption, description, version, plus the marker listing.

All three templates list fields dynamically via `[<currentTiddler>fields[]sort[]]` so new marker / vocab fields surface automatically. Each links back to [[Marker Fields]] / [[Vocabulary Meta Fields]] for the canonical reference.